When working with CC Helper: the shell hook is a soft hint — the script exits 0 and the command continues; do not paste API keys into task JSON or logs; realtime panel, Bark, and token caps require the desktop Helper from https://mymoying.com/cc-helper — this plugin alone cannot provide them.
